and that's drawn increased 
attention to the sport overall.

00:18:12.310 --> 00:18:14.870
The number of viewers has skyrocketed, too.

00:18:14.870 --> 00:18:17.000
The times are changing.

00:18:17.000 --> 00:18:17.560
Hah!

00:18:17.560 --> 00:18:20.950
And the Master of that age is 
gonna be either Suo or Harada?

00:18:20.950 --> 00:18:23.400
What a joke! It's unbelievable!

00:18:23.400 --> 00:18:25.540
Especially Harada! Unbelievable!

00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:27.580
Did something happen with 
Coach Kitano again?

00:18:25.540 --> 00:18:29.820
Unbelievable! Absolutely unbelievable!

00:18:27.580 --> 00:18:31.380
He's bitter because he didn't get a 
New Year's card from Dr. Harada.

00:18:29.820 --> 00:18:31.370
I can't believe that Harada!

00:18:34.570 --> 00:18:35.890
<i>Arata...</i>

00:18:36.340 --> 00:18:39.320
<i>That's weird. There's no way he'd miss this.</i>

00:19:00.240 --> 00:19:02.170
Yeah... hello?

00:19:02.170 --> 00:19:04.280
Arata?! You're sick?!

00:19:05.250 --> 00:19:08.350
<i>Oh... Chihaya. It's not that seri—</i>

00:19:10.670 --> 00:19:14.780
I've been at my uncle's house 
in Kyoto since yesterday.

00:19:15.230 --> 00:19:17.670
I was gonna go to Omi Jingu from here,

00:19:17.670 --> 00:19:19.880
but I woke up with a fever...

00:19:20.140 --> 00:19:22.480
W-Well, take care...

00:19:22.930 --> 00:19:26.780
<i>Y-Yeah. I'll be watching online.</i>

00:19:34.180 --> 00:19:35.200
I love you.

00:19:40.410 --> 00:19:41.810
Everyone, please take your seats.

00:19:42.360 --> 00:19:44.710
The competitors will be entering shortly.

00:19:44.710 --> 00:19:46.720
Oh! I need to turn off my phone!

00:19:46.720 --> 00:19:48.450
Power off, power off...

00:19:59.220 --> 00:20:00.920
<i>Ever since he told me he loved me,</i>

00:20:01.570 --> 00:20:04.970
<i>my stomach and fingers feel warm 
all the time. It's just weird.</i>

00:20:05.540 --> 00:20:07.740
<i>Arata's making me all weird.</i>

00:20:09.170 --> 00:20:11.630
<i>If I see him, my whole body might catch fire.</i>

00:20:18.440 --> 00:20:19.930
